quest":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls/4814","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/4814","diff_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/4814.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/4814.patch","merged_at":"2019-10-25T13:00:47Z"},"body":"- application path value does not have to start with a slash\r\n- resource should not be served from both the root and the app path\r\n- resolves #4787\r\n\r\nIMPL NOTE: We register the delegating handler in the default route (matches `HttpBuildTimeConfig.path`) for a JAX-RS root resource path of a default value `/`. However, for any other value we do register the handler in a special route that matches the root resource path. In fact, we register two routes that share the same handler. For example, for the JAX-RS root resource path `/foo` we register two routes, first matches `/foo` (exact match) and the second one matches `/foo/*`. And the reason is that otherwise the resources would be served from both the root and the app path - see the issue description for an example.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/4814/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/4814/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2740044290,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDI3NDAwNDQyOTA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/2740044290","actor":{"login":"mkouba","id":913004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMzAwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/913004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba","html_url":"https://github.com/mkouba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api